  "tagline": "Client-side sync framework for instant web UIs; now free, open source and in maintenance mode.",
  "description": "Replicache is a JavaScript framework that keeps a transactional key-value cache in the browser (persisted in IndexedDB) in sync with your own backend. Mutators run optimistically on the client and are replayed authoritatively on the server through push and pull endpoints you implement, which gives Linear-style instant UIs on any backend stack. Rocicorp has put it in maintenance mode: the code is open source, licence fees are gone, and the team's effort has moved to Zero. Existing users get fixes, but new projects should start with Zero.",
